    {
      "id": "7eafc1e9-8db2-4fd4-a067-18293a4b5c6d",
      "slug": "why-72-hour-dough",
      "title": "Why our dough takes 72 hours",
      "excerpt": "Slow fermentation is the whole secret. Here is what happens in the fridge.",
      "body_md": "## Time does the work\n\nOur dough is mixed on Monday and baked on Thursday. Three days in the cold room lets the yeast work slowly, so the crust blisters and the base stays light.\n\n### What you taste\n\n- A sour edge from the long ferment\n- Big air pockets in the cornicione\n- A base that holds up to San Marzano sauce\n\nCome and try it at Call Lane or Byram Street.",
      "cover_url": "https://yhzjgyrkyjabvhblqxzu.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/web-assets/6f1c2a40-9b7e-4c3a-9a1e-2b6d4e8f0a11/dough.jpg",
      "author": "Marco",
      "tags": ["dough", "kitchen"],
      "published_at": "2026-10-20T10:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "8fb0d2fa-9ec3-4ae5-b178-293a4b5c6d7e",
      "slug": "huddersfield-is-open",
      "title": "Huddersfield is open",
      "excerpt": "Our second oven is lit. Byram Street opens Tuesday to Sunday.",
      "body_md": "We opened the doors on Byram Street last Friday. Same dough, same oven, five minutes from the station.\n\nOrder online for collection and skip the queue.",
